' ActiveBasic 既定に含まれない Win32 API

Declare Function AppendMenu Lib "user32.dll" Alias "AppendMenuA" (ByVal hMenu As HMENU, ByVal uFlags As Long, ByVal uIDNewItem As Long, ByVal lpNewItem As String) As Long
Declare Function CheckMenuItem Lib "user32.dll" (ByVal hMenu As HMENU, ByVal uIDCheckItem As Long, ByVal uCheck As Long) As Long
